<jnt = 'http://www.jahia.org/jahia/nt/1.0'>
<jmix = 'http://www.jahia.org/jahia/mix/1.0'>
<j = 'http://www.jahia.org/jahia/1.0'>
<jcr = 'http://www.jcp.org/jcr/1.0'>
<mix = 'http://www.jcp.org/jcr/mix/1.0'>
<ctpl = 'http://www.jahia.org/classic-templates/nt/1.0'>
<ctplmix = 'http://www.jahia.org/classic-templates/mix/1.0'>

// A sign-in form as a page section: an optional heading (jcr:title), an introduction, then a
// username, a password and a button that sign the visitor in without leaving the site. Put it on the
// page the header's sign-in entry points to. Once signed in, the visitor goes to the page named in
// the address (the "redirect" parameter, set by the pages that asked them to sign in), else to
// afterSignIn, else to the home page. A visitor who is already signed in sees who they are instead.
[ctpl:signIn] > jnt:content, mix:title, ctplmix:pageComponent, ctplmix:sectionStyle
 - introText (string, textarea) i18n
 - afterSignIn (weakreference, picker[type='page']) < jnt:page
